  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  note: 'Statue of maya.

    Has a mermaid tail.

    Bolumptious body. Long curly
    hair which covers the figures entire face.

    The tail has quite a lot of detail,
    including a stray piece of seaweed wrapped around it, and some barnacles covering
    it.

    Has skinny arms with big webbed hands

'
