--- !u!114 &1555122850
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1555122849}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e439db915681c13489c8e8fba6f8ae7a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  note: 'A safe below some kind of mechanism

    A calendar sits atop it.

    A
    star with 4 square slots surrounding it.

    One of the slots has a small statue
    in it.

    The statue seems to be a tree, vaguely in the shape of a woman elf.

    The
    proportions seem to get smaller, the taller up the figure is.

    The legs are
    wide, and morph together to form the base of a tree trunk.

    The head is smaller.
    The arms are very long, with long fingers, resembling tree branches.


    Inside
    the actual safe, is the button to floor 3.'
